{"id":"vod_sn_37240","vodId":"37240","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"超级机器人大战OG·the inspector","name_cn":"超级机器人大战OG·the inspector","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5395e1201fe6e7851f5e99aa90c92c33.jpg"},"summary":"《超级机器人大战·原创世纪》的背景是新西历，人类正式开始进出宇宙2世纪，但因为2次大型陨石的坠下，人们的生活还是维持在21世纪初。到了新西历179年，第3颗陨石“流星3(メテオ3)”坠落于南太平洋的マーケサズ群岛海面。地球连邦政府经过调查，发现是由人类未知的技术制造的物体，这种地球以外的技术被称为EOT(Extra over technology)。地球连邦政府组成了“EOT特别审议会”和“EOTI机关”进行调查。然后EOTI机关的代表比安博士发表了研究结果，表示地球有被宇宙以外的生命体侵略的危机。从此，人型机动兵器：Personal Trooper的研究开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bN2uY0JaRX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HZaEQBSdnx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KL14WDCi7i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XWfrewHApZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Crq0y90Fmy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w3DhraK8eW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DchKTdemnP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U5e9Kr7jVc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6TxuscP4b71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mWW9MNSiwN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BYe1xRdNc11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TP04JGvLdu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K9zzE6p9qE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5kE0UTVW8T